{"id":"vod_bf_16520","vodId":"16520","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"境界触发者第一季","name_cn":"境界触发者第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/3dc3438dd4e25ee7af60561c66ff196e.jpg"},"summary":"拥有28万人口的三门市，其境内某天突然打开了一扇通往未知世界的大门。从大门的另一端，被称为“近界民”的怪物蜂拥而出。人类惊慌失措之余发现，地球现有的武器对近界民完全没有任何效果。危急时刻，神秘团体境界防卫组织“BORDER”出现击退近界民，三门市总算回归往昔的正常生活。如是过了四年半的时间，隐藏着作为“BORDER”成员身份的初中学生三云修（梶裕贵 配音）和转学生空闲游真（村中知 配音）相遇，而对方竟然是来自门另一头的近界民，此行的目的是为了找到自己的父亲。分出不同阵营的二人，注定要在命运的战争中激烈碰撞……　　本片根据苇原大介的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:02:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":73,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005LLs3e7J1index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410054BSjyYYIindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005uiweC3Gkindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005nbhAall3index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005JQ9D0SgOindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005aOZpUlGkindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005C2o6GRACindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005CrG2mu7Mindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005xUNNLlCEindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241005hLCIQ22Dindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410052C6UG5Oain